# Optional hard roster for the lab hub.
#
# Copy this file into the VM as /var/lib/jupyterhub/students.txt (it lives on
# the persistent data disk, so it survives rebuilds) and restart the hub:
#
#     systemctl restart jupyterhub
#
# With the file present, only the usernames listed here -- plus the admins from
# ./launch.sh --admin -- may log in. Signup still works, but a name that is not
# on the list will be refused at login, INCLUDING accounts that already existed
# before the roster was introduced. Delete the file and restart to go back to
# approval-only mode, where the /hub/authorize queue is the whitelist.
#
# One username per line; blank lines and #-comments are ignored.

ivanov
petrova
